    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>ProgressBar, StepsProgressBar, CircleProgress, and DashboardProgress cover linear, stepped, circular, and dashboard progress indicators with status, size, gradient, and layout options.</source>
        <target state="translated">ProgressBar、StepsProgressBar、CircleProgress 和 DashboardProgress 覆盖线性、步骤、环形与仪表盘进度展示，并支持状态、尺寸、渐变和布局配置。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Visualize task completion and operation progress.</source>
        <target state="translated">展示任务完成度与操作进度。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PercentPositionDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Change the position of the progress value, you can use percentPosition to adjust it so that the progress bar value is inside, outside or at the bottom of the progress bar.</source>
        <target state="translated">改变进度值的位置，可使用 percentPosition 将进度值调整到进度条内部、外部或底部。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
